			"Message": "feat(Project): Eliminate startup visual flash across Mountain, Sky, and Wind\n\nCoordinate startup sequence improvements across three submodules to eliminate the \"purple/dark flash\" and panel-pop flicker observed on cold boot:\n\n- **Mountain (993a69a7):** Implement hidden-until-ready window pattern using WebviewWindowBuilder.visible(false), reveal only when Sky reports phase 3 (Restored). Add 3s safety timer to force-reveal if Sky crashes before phase 3 (prevents invisible-window lockup).\n\n- **Sky (0cf2e4da):** Add missing SkyBridge initialization to Electron Layout to subscribe to cel:* Tauri events (tree-view, SCM, debug, extensions). Previously, panels painted empty on first frame then re-rendered with data, causing \"tree-views flash empty then pop\".\n\n- **Wind (bb3b6fc3):** Add PostHogDefines to TargetConfig.ts mapping LAND_POSTHOG_* environment variables to esbuild define directives. Completes the hardcoded-key removal work, enabling PostHog config driven entirely by environment variables.\n\nImpact: Eliminates four-repaint startup cascade (native chrome → #1e1e1e → VS Code theme → workbench DOM). All panels now render with data on first paint.",
			"SHA": "3ff9bbf02757290f4128143f97cfbaecfd01c5ec"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-23T21:18:38Z",
			"File": [
				"⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				5
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Project): Remove hardcoded PostHog keys and decompose Utilities\n\nCoordinate submodule updates across Mountain, Sky, and Wind to remove hardcoded credentials and improve module organization:\n\n- **Mountain (8cba79c0):** Decompose monolithic Utilities.rs into 7 domain-specific modules (ApplicationRoot, ChannelPriority, JsonValueHelpers, MetadataEncoding, PathExtraction, RecentlyOpened, UserdataDir). Update all call sites to use explicit reverse-hierarchical paths (e.g., `Utilities::PathExtraction::extract_path_from_arg`).\n\n- **Mountain (5140a389):** Simplify binary/library names from verbose development format back to 'Mountain' in Cargo.toml and tauri.conf.json. Remove PostHog API key from build.rs and bootstrap-fork.js. Clean up tauri.conf.json identifier to 'land.editor.binary'.\n\n- **Sky (9b67e2e6):** Remove hardcoded PostHog API key from PostHogBridge.ts and astro.config.ts, requiring LAND_POSTHOG_KEY environment variable.\n\n- **Wind (a0e09d67):** Remove hardcoded PostHog API key from Configuration.ts.\n\nImpact: Security hardening by eliminating hardcoded credentials across 3 submodules. Improved code organization with explicit module dependencies following CLAUDE.md requirements.",
			"SHA": "b03e5a60d3d19957ab41a059dc5e5d8150bb2842"
